## Automated QA re-test — feature merge landed on master

**Trigger:** verifier card ${trigger.card_id} completed with verdict=PASS
**Merge commit:** ${trigger.merged_commit_sha}

Build the project, run it as a real user, and verify nothing is broken. File any findings as beads linked to the parent epic.

**Completion metadata contract:**
- PASS: metadata={verdict: "PASS", claims_tested: N, claims_passed: N, findings_count: 0, bug_bead_ids: [], commit_tested: "<sha>"}
- FAIL: metadata={verdict: "FAIL", claims_tested: N, claims_passed: N, findings_count: N, bug_bead_ids: ["bug-1"], commit_tested: "<sha>"}
